Writing a Scroll
================

You cannot write a scroll you haven't identified first.  You just lose the
scroll and the amount of charges from your magic marker that it takes to
write the scroll you wanted.
Scrolls first:

these cost 8 uses each.
 LIGHT
 GOLD_DETECTION:
