 REMOVE_CURSE:
 ENCHANT_WEAPON:
 CHARGING:

these cost 20 each:
 SCARE_MONSTER:
 TAMING:
 TELEPORTATION:

and the granddaddy of them all costs 30 uses!!
 GENOCIDE:

